{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f0ac59e4-a91f-8d24-9e2c-396fd201379a",
  "created_at": "2026-01-05T11:52:35-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dario Duarte",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:48:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:48:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah. I got a parking ticket and I want to dispute it. It's for being too close to a hydrant."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:48:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you have the ticket in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:49:03-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hold on, I've got it on my lap. I'm on speaker, I'm in a waiting room, so if it echoes, sorry. [pause] Okay. It says, um, violation, parking within, uh, fifteen feet of a hydrant."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:49:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that's the standard one. And what's your issue with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:49:23-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The issue is I wasn't fifteen feet. I mean, I wasn't within fifteen feet. I was way back from it. The officer wrote that I was right up on it, and that's just not what happened. I paced it off after. It was like, I don't know, twenty-two, twenty-three feet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:49:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You paced it off. With your own feet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:49:47-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, with my own feet. I'm not a surveyor, but I'm not off by that much. [line breaks up] anyway, it's a hassle. I have a magazine open here and I can't even read it because I'm dealing with this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:50:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Sounds like a pretty good use of a waiting room, though, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:50:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha. Not really. So can I appeal it? Like in writing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:50:14-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can. A written appeal is the way to go for that. You'd put down what happened, your name, the ticket number, and the plate number, and say why you think the ticket's wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:50:28-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. Wait, let me find the, um, the back of this thing. [pause] It says something about contesting but the print is tiny. It says, uh, to contest this citation, see reverse, and then it just cuts off where it was folded."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:50:45-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, they fold those into a tiny envelope. Send it to the City of Newport, Finance Department, parking violations, at City Hall. That's on Broadway. Attention parking appeals is fine too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:50:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Broadway. Okay. Is there a specific address number, or does City Hall just get it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:51:05-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Hall will get it. Mail goes to the right desk. Just put the ticket number on the outside of your letter and inside, so nobody has to go hunting."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:51:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And do I have to pay it first? Because I don't want to pay it and then fight it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:51:26-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally you appeal within the window that's printed on the ticket, and that's what keeps the late penalties from piling on. Check the date on yours. If it's close, I'd get the letter in the mail today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:51:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The date, uh. [pause] It was the, hmm, the twenty-ninth. Of December."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:51:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so you're still early. Should be fine if you mail it this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:51:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Can I send photos with it? I took a few of the car and the hydrant."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:52:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, include them. Photos help. Just make copies and keep the originals."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:52:06-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. They're calling my name, I think. [crosstalk] Sorry, one sec. Yeah, I'm coming. Okay, I gotta go. Do I need to give you my number or anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:52:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not for this. Put it in the letter if you want someone to reach you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:52:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks. Appreciate it, I guess. Annoying way to start the year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:52:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good luck with it. Enjoy the magazine."
    }
  ],
